00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:30,640
And it's a good way to descend into madness, is what that is.

300
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:31,200
Yeah.

301
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:32,160
Yeah.

302
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:36,880
So we put in a bit both in the beginning to get things going.

