00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:14,000
And then as we rolled off of those, we did make some decisions to be more like cost efficient, but it was overall totally fine.

312
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:19,200
Yeah, you have to figure in like the giving away tokens at the beginning of an experience is just part of your CAC kind of, right?

